  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T13:44:48.316533Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T06:04:57.661335Z",
  "totalBlocks": 18,
  "translatedBlocks": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "624f45b9052ddeeb",
      "translationZh": "我想分享一个新的 TensorSharp 演示，并听听社区的反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c48a9be6e115b21",
      "translationZh": "TensorSharp 最初是一个用于运行本地 GGUF 模型的 .NET 推理引擎。现在，它已能超越模型推理，通过技能、代码生成、环境配置和工具使用来执行完整的智能体工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7c54563afa92d2d",
      "translationZh": "在这个演示中，我向一个通过 TensorSharp 在本地运行的量化 Gemma 4 模型提供了一个提示词：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d71bd17674687ced",
      "translationZh": "请查看今天涨幅最大的 10 只股票，并为我生成一份 pptx 格式的报告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fe8dd77fd600d72",
      "translationZh": "仅凭这一个请求，TensorSharp 就能让本地模型完成以下操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f20c5b63d243be77",
      "translationZh": "将任务拆分为市场数据检索、处理和演示文稿生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4772ca62398e6649",
      "translationZh": "检查可用工具和执行环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a1546afd6b1a08ff",
      "translationZh": "安装它所需的 Python 依赖项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e237de919777f5a8",
      "translationZh": "编写并执行代码，以获取当前公开的股票市场数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "991998cd9eb865ee",
      "translationZh": "检查输出，识别解析问题，并改进自身的实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "774915eafcf56466",
      "translationZh": "生成一个 Node.js/PptxGenJS 脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "213de21b4dd1ec45",
      "translationZh": "生成一个真正的 PowerPoint 文件，可直接在 Microsoft PowerPoint 中打开。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8576a99fa9f1e085",
      "translationZh": "所有 LLM 推理均在本地运行。不涉及 OpenAI、Anthropic 或其他托管模型 API，因此该工作流的 LLM API 成本为零。只有智能体的工具会使用网络访问来获取公开市场数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61438c75cdc99f6d",
      "translationZh": "有意思的并不是股票报告本身，而是推理、技能、工具调用、自动代码生成、依赖配置、迭代式问题求解和产物创建，如今都能在同一个本地运行时中协同工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "707baa0eb9b7da02",
      "translationZh": "TensorSharp 正在超越推理引擎的范畴。目标是将其打造为一个统一的开源 .NET 运行时，同时支持本地模型推理和智能体执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e298652ae5ffb04",
      "translationZh": "为节省时间，视频已加速播放。我尤其希望收到关于技能系统、工具权限模型、执行隔离，以及你们接下来希望看到的本地智能体工作流的反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
